{"unit_id":"tianyaojiudi-prog__dsh-djy-xttsc#card-zh","repo":"tianyaojiudi-prog/dsh-djy-xttsc","commit":"0b94db01b8edfd73b71a279f45bd25d80ab0e06a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-djy-xttsc 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的系统提示词设置插件：它在设置面板提供可编辑的全局提示词段，并将其注册到 systemPrompt。用户可启停注入、修改文本或恢复默认；提示词按全局段参与会话和子代理的组装，关闭或留空时不输出。插件兼容旧版设置命名空间与新版条目配置表单。适合希望统一调整 DSH 会话指令的人；需要 DSH 的 systemPrompt 服务，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:317-384","index.js:227-230","client.js:232-280","client.js:307-315","cordis.patch.yml:11-13"]}
{"unit_id":"tianyaojiudi-prog__dsh-djy-xttsc#card-en","repo":"tianyaojiudi-prog/dsh-djy-xttsc","commit":"0b94db01b8edfd73b71a279f45bd25d80ab0e06a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-djy-xttsc adds a global system prompt section to DSH. Users can edit its text, toggle it, or restore the default in the web settings panel. The section applies to sessions and subagents and is omitted when disabled or blank. It supports both legacy settings and the newer plugin config form.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:317-384","index.js:227-230","client.js:232-280","client.js:307-315","cordis.patch.yml:11-13"]}
