{"unit_id":"tianyaojiudi-prog__dsh-djy-xttsc#feature-1","repo":"tianyaojiudi-prog/dsh-djy-xttsc","commit":"0b94db01b8edfd73b71a279f45bd25d80ab0e06a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-djy-xttsc 的功能「全局系统提示词」：把用户配置的文本注册为全局提示词段，供会话和子代理组装提示词时读取。Host 调用 systemPrompt 组装时触发；开关关闭或内容为空白时不输出该段。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:227-230","index.js:366-384"]}
{"unit_id":"tianyaojiudi-prog__dsh-djy-xttsc#feature-2","repo":"tianyaojiudi-prog/dsh-djy-xttsc","commit":"0b94db01b8edfd73b71a279f45bd25d80ab0e06a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-djy-xttsc 的功能「设置页编辑与启停」：在 DSH 设置面板显示开关和文本框。用户可切换启用状态、保存自定义内容或恢复默认值，表单通过当前可用的设置配置通道写回 Host。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:232-280","client.js:307-315"]}
{"unit_id":"tianyaojiudi-prog__dsh-djy-xttsc#feature-3","repo":"tianyaojiudi-prog/dsh-djy-xttsc","commit":"0b94db01b8edfd73b71a279f45bd25d80ab0e06a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-djy-xttsc 的功能「双版本设置兼容」：Host 侧检查旧版 settings.register，并回退读取插件配置；客户端按 settingsScope 或 configForms 服务注册同一设置页，避免重复挂载。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:323-353","client.js:8-19","client.js:317-324"]}
